{
  "description": "The one owner of every colour, type size, spacing, radius, elevation, motion value and icon. scripts/gen-tokens.mjs writes core/app/styles/tokens.css from it, and a test fails when that file is stale or when component CSS carries a literal value. The palette is the Control UI's own light and dark palette rather than the platform's: the app stops wearing a system-blue accent, a platform font stack and platform chrome (issue 59). A theme the server holds overrides these values through core/app/rules/theme.js, so the tokens stay the one owner of any value two surfaces must agree on.",
