  "icons": { "description":"The icon set, taken from the sibling app (Chela), which draws the Control UI's own stroked icons: a 24-unit viewBox, no fill, round caps and joins, stroked at icon.stroke unless a glyph names its own weight (the back arrow is drawn at 1.7, as Chela draws it, to hold the same optical weight at its smaller size). scripts/gen-tokens.mjs writes each glyph into tokens.css as a mask, so an element with class icon and data-icon set to a name here draws that glyph in its own text colour, in either scheme and under any theme, with no SVG written in a component. sf-symbol names the glyph's SF Symbol, the one the iOS client draws for the same name. x, check, circle-x, alert-triangle and info are Chela's own set; the rest are the Control UI icons this app's controls need, from the same family. messages-square is the chats list: on a phone every way back to the chats list draws it, never a back arrow (issue 168).","glyphs":{"x":{"sf-symbol":"xmark","svg":[["path",{"d":"M18 6 6 18"}],["path",{"d":"m6 6 12 12"}]]},"check":{"sf-symbol":"checkmark","svg":[["path",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}]]},"circle-x":{"sf-symbol":"xmark.circle","svg":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["path",{"d":"m15 9-6 6"}],["path",{"d":"m9 9 6 6"}]]},"alert-triangle":{"sf-symbol":"exclamationmark.triangle","svg":[["path",{"d":"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.46 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"}],["path",{"d":"M12 9v4"}],["path",{"d":"M12 17h.01"}]]},"info":{"sf-symbol":"info.circle","svg":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"}],["path",{"d":"M12 16v-4"}],["path",{"d":"M12 8h.01"}]]},"settings":{"sf-symbol":"gearshape","svg":[["circle",{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"3"}],["path",{"d":"M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83 2.83l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-4 0v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 1 1-2.83-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1 0-4h.09A1.